{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\UsageStatisticsServer\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dev-tools-in-root",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "phpunit/phpunit is in require-dev of composer.json. The manual recommends a vendor-bin/ of bamarni/composer-bin-plugin per tool, so that the dependencies of a tool cannot conflict with those of the app."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "transaction-manual",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Db/ReportRepository.php:63",
        "lib/Service/RetentionService.php:34"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "2 transactions are opened and closed by hand. The trait TTransactional has atomic() since Nextcloud 24 and atomicRetry() since Nextcloud 27, which repeats a transaction that ran into a deadlock, as the manual recommends.",
        "  lib/Db/ReportRepository.php:63",
        "  lib/Service/RetentionService.php:34"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "time-direct",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Controller/StatisticsController.php:196 new DateTimeImmutable()",
        "lib/Db/ReportRepository.php:61 new DateTimeImmutable()",
        "lib/Db/SchemaRepository.php:82 new DateTimeImmutable()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "lib/ reads the clock directly in 3 places. OCP\\AppFramework\\Utility\\ITimeFactory, a PSR-20 ClockInterface, gives the same time and can be replaced in a test.",
        "  lib/Controller/StatisticsController.php:196 new DateTimeImmutable()",
        "  lib/Db/ReportRepository.php:61 new DateTimeImmutable()",
        "  lib/Db/SchemaRepository.php:82 new DateTimeImmutable()"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "config-without-lexicon",
      "level": "info",
      "places": [
        "lib/Service/SettingsService.php:24 getValueInt()",
        "lib/Service/SettingsService.php:42 setValueInt()"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "The app reads and writes its app config in 2 places and registers no config lexicon, which IRegistrationContext::registerConfigLexicon() takes since Nextcloud 31. A lexicon states the type, the default and the sensitivity of each key in one place.",
        "  lib/Service/SettingsService.php:24 getValueInt()",
        "  lib/Service/SettingsService.php:42 setValueInt()"
      ]
    }
  ],
